{"segment_id": "segment_00009", "start": 270.0, "end": 300.0, "speech": "话，第一单元有做过示范，不多说了。然后 summary writing 呢，摘要写作，那对于各位来说，两个点，第一两篇文章，这是第一篇，这是第二篇。看的时候，包括写的时候，重点看那些连词啊。OK， topic for discussion，老习惯，我就说一遍题。Supposing the man was not the murderer, what other reasons might he have had for lying to the inspector? 假设这男的就不是谋杀犯，他有没有什么其他的原因，对", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000032.webp", "time": 272.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Summary writing: Key", "训练目标：", "写作复述能力"], "scores": [0.97781, 0.98222, 0.99971], "boxes": [[[54.0, 132.0], [567.0, 139.0], [566.0, 203.0], [53.0, 195.0]], [[108.0, 334.0], [342.0, 334.0], [342.0, 394.0], [108.0, 394.0]], [[110.0, 398.0], [414.0, 398.0], [414.0, 459.0], [110.0, 459.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000033.webp", "time": 275.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Summary writing: Key", "At the time of the murder, the man claimed", "that he had been travelling on the 8 o'clock", "train to London and had arrived at work on", "time. When the inspector asked if a later", "train would get him to work on time, the man", "agreed it would but said that he always", "travelled early. The inspector suggested that", "he was lying because, that morning, the 8", "o'clock train broke down, so the man must", "have caught the 8. 25."], "scores": [0.98488, 0.96615, 0.97857, 0.98629, 0.9747, 0.99024, 0.98665, 0.98826, 0.97666, 0.97585, 0.98049], "boxes": [[[53.0, 130.0], [567.0, 135.0], [566.0, 204.0], [52.0, 198.0]], [[107.0, 331.0], [1097.0, 331.0], [1097.0, 392.0], [107.0, 392.0]], [[106.0, 391.0], [1104.0, 393.0], [1104.0, 456.0], [106.0, 454.0]], [[105.0, 456.0], [1091.0, 454.0], [1091.0, 512.0], [105.0, 514.0]], [[105.0, 515.0], [1036.0, 515.0], [1036.0, 578.0], [105.0, 578.0]], [[104.0, 578.0], [1139.0, 578.0], [1139.0, 639.0], [104.0, 639.0]], [[103.0, 635.0], [1009.0, 633.0], [1009.0, 706.0], [103.0, 708.0]], [[102.0, 699.0], [1132.0, 697.0], [1132.0, 765.0], [102.0, 767.0]], [[102.0, 757.0], [1064.0, 757.0], [1064.0, 829.0], [102.0, 829.0]], [[108.0, 823.0], [1083.0, 